<title>CHINA: Trading in Yizheng shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Yizheng shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Yizheng Chemical Fibre Co Ltd was suspended on Thursday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Yizheng shares surged HK$0.725 or 38.16 percent to HK$2.625 on Wednesday on volume of 218.01 million shares worth HK$500 million.</p>
<p>Brokers said anticipation of better earnings outlook on speculation of a merger with a mainland petrochemical firm boosted buying.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
